  "releaseNotes": "v1.4.3: ELEMainFrame gains full designer support — a new ELEMainFrameDesigner (ParentControlDesigner) promotes its SideBar and Content panels into nested design surfaces, so child controls can be dragged onto and selected directly inside them at design time (SideBar/Content are now Content-serialized); ELENavMenu items and their nested Children can now be edited straight from the Properties window collection editor (Children is browsable and content-serialized for recursive multi-level setup); System.Design is referenced on the net48 target to host the designer types",
